  "item_short_desc": "<p>Be ready at a moment&rsquo;s notice with our Concealed Carry MA-1 Flight Jacket. The CCW jacket features a warm poly fiber fill for exceptional insulation in cold conditions while offering best-in-class discrete carry. The concealed carry bomber jacket features a nylon water-repellent outer shell that provides protection from light rain and snow. Whether you are on-duty or out traveling, stay prepared with this everyday jacket.</p>",
  "no_ratings": null,
  "sort_order": "934",
  "description": "<p>Be ready at a moment&rsquo;s notice with our Concealed Carry MA-1 Flight Jacket. The CCW jacket features a warm poly fiber fill for exceptional insulation in cold conditions while offering best-in-class discrete carry. The concealed carry bomber jacket features a nylon water-repellent outer shell that provides protection from light rain and snow. Whether you are on-duty or out traveling, stay prepared with this everyday jacket. CCW Design: Rothco&rsquo;s ambidextrous concealed carry pocket system features dual built-in padded pockets designed to safely and discretely holster firearms and personal accessories. In addition, each side features 2 internal mag pouches. Tactical Pockets: The military pilot&rsquo;s coat comes equipped with 5 additional pockets: 2 front slash pockets and 2 inner welt pockets for everyday essentials, and what&rsquo;s a bomber jacket without a zippered utility sleeve pocket!? Along with exterior pen holders, this useful pocket is great for storing small items. Unbeatable Comfort and Warmth: These aviator flight jackets feature a soft ribbed knit collar, cuffs, and waistband for additional heat retention and insulation while blocking out the wind. The MA-1 military bomber jacket has an extra full cut for a comfortable fit with room underneath for extra layers, ideal for winter and cold weather. Iconic MA-1 Styling: Inspired by the original design for fighter pilots, our rugged and dependable MA-1 Flight Bomber Jackets feature a reversible orange polyester lining. The zippered front closure with double &lsquo;MA-1&rsquo; pull tabs and storm flap, brass zippers, and leather pull tab pays homage to the jacket&rsquo;s heritage, functionality, and style. Take Flight: Whether you are military personnel, aviation enthusiast, or outdoor adventurer, the discrete carry flight jacket is perfect as a windbreaker for spring and fall seasons while presenting a classic style that is great for casual outings and everyday use.</p>",
